<section id="demo" class="border-b border-white/5 bg-navy-950/40">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6 py-20 sm:py-28">
    <div class="text-center">
      <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-ember-500">See it work</h2>
      <p class="text-balance mt-3 text-2xl font-bold text-fog-100 sm:text-3xl">
        A real terminal session against a live HUPI gateway — not a mockup.
      </p>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed text-fog-300">
        Tell it something, trigger the real consolidation pass on demand instead of waiting
        overnight, then start a brand-new conversation — no mention of "Aurora" in it — and watch
        it recall exactly what it was told.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-ink shadow-2xl shadow-black/40">
      <img
        src="/demo.gif"
        alt="Terminal recording against the live public demo: a curl request tells HUPI a project's codename and ship date, a consolidate-now call runs the real nightly consolidation job on demand, and a brand-new conversation that never mentions the codename gets a reply correctly recalling both facts."
        width="1105"
        height="529"
        loading="lazy"
        class="w-full"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="mt-6 text-center">
      <a
        href="/demo"
        class="text-sm font-semibold text-ember-500 underline decoration-dotted hover:text-ember-400"
      >
        Try this yourself, live — no signup →
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
